  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.43 - AM031 sync-over-async awaiter detection\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM031 now reports GetAwaiter().GetResult() sync-over-async calls in MapFrom expressions\n            - Detection covers Task, configured Task, ValueTask, and configured ValueTask awaiter shapes\n            - Descriptor wording and docs now describe the broader sync-over-async family\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (843 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #118 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.42 - AM020 implicit nested conversion modelling",
